case fuzz_regex
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir qvto-testkit/fuzz/regex
qvto regex.qvto
note Java's find loop in replaceAll (an empty match after a non-empty one)
end

case fuzz_iterate_names
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir qvto-testkit/fuzz/iterate_names
qvto iterate_names.qvto
note iterate adds its result variable before evaluating the source; a variable of the same name added meanwhile makes the expression invalid
end

case fuzz_floats
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir qvto-testkit/fuzz/floats
qvto floats.qvto
in floats.xmi
mmfile ../fuzz.ecore
note Float (EFloat) and Long (ELong) values: = with promotion, sortedBy keys by Java class, oclIsTypeOf/oclAsType Real
end

case fuzz_collcopy_interm
driver fuzz
kind log
features fuzz
dir qvto-testkit/fuzz/collcopy
qvto interm.qvto
in interm.xmi
mmfile ../fuzz.ecore
note collection-typed module properties, intermediate features and contextual properties are copied on every read (coerceValue): order of identity-hashed sets with colliding hashes
end

